== diags.diag/borrow-escapes-region
BYN3002 7:16 the `stackalloc` buffer on line 4 does not live as long as `view`, which borrows it
  label the `stackalloc` buffer on line 4 is freed at the end of its block
  help copy the data with `.copy(to: alloc)` into an allocator that lives long enough
BYN3002 13:16 arena `arena` does not live as long as `kept`, which borrows it
  label arena `arena` is freed at the end of its block
  help copy the data with `.copy(to: alloc)` into an allocator that lives long enough
